# A Profile of End-User Searching Behavior by Humanities Scholars: The Getty Online Searching Report Project No. 2.

**Authors:** Siegfried, Susan, And Others

## Abstract
Reports on searching behavior of humanities scholars who were given unlimited, subsidized access to DIALOG databases. How much searching the scholars did, the kinds of techniques and DIALOG features they used, and their learning curves are analyzed. Search features studied included commands, Boolean logic, types of vocabulary, and proximity operators. (46 references) (KRN)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ464383

